var FDM={"Familiar Keeper":{"free":[[1,"Find Familiar"]],"ab":"asi"},"Pyromaniac":{"can":["Fire Bolt"],"free":[[1,"Burning Hands"],[1,"Scorching Ray"]],"ab":"asi"},"Spellblade":{"pk":[{"k":"c1","title":"Blade cantrip 1","lv":0,"nm":["Arc Blade","Burning Blade","Frigid Blade","True Strike"],"use":"Cantrip"},{"k":"c2","title":"Blade cantrip 2","lv":0,"nm":["Arc Blade","Burning Blade","Frigid Blade","True Strike"],"use":"Cantrip"}],"ab":"asi"}};
