var GR=[["Ball Bearings",1,2,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: spill them across a level 10-ft square within 10 ft of you. A creature entering for the first time on a turn makes a Dexterity save or falls Prone. Recovering them takes 10 minutes."],["Ballista Trap",10,0,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: set up in an open space within 5 ft and aim it. It triggers when a creature first enters, or ends its turn in, a 30-ft by 5-ft Line from it. It makes a ranged attack (Intelligence modifier plus Masterwork Bonus plus Proficiency Bonus) for 1d8 Piercing. A creature triggers only one per turn. Recovering it takes a Utilize action."],["Caltrops",1,2,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: scatter them over a 5-ft square within 5 ft. A creature entering for the first time on a turn makes a Dexterity save or takes 1 Piercing damage and has Speed 0 until its next turn starts. Recovering them takes 10 minutes."],["Hunting Trap",2.5,25,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: set a toothed steel trap chained to something fixed. A creature that steps on the plate makes a Dexterity save or takes 1d4 Piercing damage and has Speed 0 until its next turn starts, then its movement is limited by the chain (about 3 ft). A Strength (Athletics) check against your Traps save DC frees a creature in reach. Each failed check deals 1 Piercing damage. Recovering it takes a Utilize action."],["Razor Wire",5,0,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: lay it in up to four connected 5-ft Cubes on the ground within 10 ft. The area is Difficult Terrain. A creature moving in it takes 1d4 Slashing damage per 5 ft traveled. It cannot be recovered."],["Trigger Bomb",5,0,"Adventuring Gear","Utilize action: toss it into an open space within 30 ft. When a creature moves within 5 ft, use your Reaction to detonate it in a 5-ft Emanation. Dexterity save, 1d6 Fire on a fail or half on a success. Loose flammable objects there catch fire and other Trigger Bombs there explode. A creature saves once per turn. Recovering it takes a Utilize action."],["Bullets (10)",3,1.5,"Ammunition","Ten firearm bullets. Firearm ammunition is destroyed when used."],["Cannonballs (5)",25,10,"Ammunition","Five cannonballs. Destroyed when used."],["Flares (5)",5,5,"Ammunition","Five flares. Destroyed when used."],["Grenades (5)",25,3,"Ammunition","Five grenades. Destroyed when used."],["Shells (10)",5,1.5,"Ammunition","Ten shotgun shells. Destroyed when used."],["Shot (10)",1,2,"Ammunition","Ten pieces of shot. Destroyed when used."]];
